# Keyboard shortcuts [Search shortcuts]
=== column 1
## Record
[R]                    Start / stop recording
[O]                    Record over the selection
[D]                    Discard the last take (to the bin)
[Esc]                  Cancel recording, deselect, close overlay
## Output
[F]                    Save the frame at the playhead (PNG)  (default P)
[Ctrl][E]              Export…
## Global (niri)
[Mod][Shift][R]        Record toggle
[Mod][Shift][O]        Record over
[Mod][Shift][D]        Discard last take
<Copy niri snippet>
=== column 2
## Playback
[Space]                Play / pause
[J]                    Shuttle reverse (again: 2×, 4×)
[K]                    Shuttle stop
[L]                    Shuttle forward (again: 2×, 4×)
[←]                    Previous frame
[→]                    Next frame
[Shift][←]             Back 1 s
[Shift][→]             Forward 1 s
[↑]                    Previous edit point
[↓]                    Next edit point
[Home]                 Timeline start
[End]                  Timeline end
## View
[=]                    Zoom timeline in
[−]                    Zoom timeline out
[\]                    Zoom to fit
[Z]                    Zoom to the selection
[N]                    Toggle snapping
[Tab]                  Switch canvas Live / Program
[B]                    Toggle the bin
[?]                    Cheat sheet
[Ctrl][K] [:]          Command palette
[Ctrl][,]              Settings
[F6]                   Focus the next region
[Shift][F6]            Focus the previous region
[Ctrl][Q]              Quit
=== column 3
## Edit
[,]                    Select previous clip
[.]                    Select next clip
[<]                    Move selection left one slot
[>]                    Move selection right one slot
[S]                    Split clip at the playhead
[[]                    Trim start to the playhead
[]]                    Trim end to the playhead
[Alt][[]               Trim 1 frame off the start
[Alt][]]               Trim 1 frame off the end
[Alt][{]               Trim 10 frames off the start
[Alt][}]               Trim 10 frames off the end
[Del] [X] [Backspace]  Remove selected clips (to the bin)
[C]                    Autocut the selection, or every clip
[Shift][C]             Autocut settings and preview
[Ctrl][Z]              Undo
[Ctrl][Shift][Z] [Ctrl][Y] Redo
[Ctrl][A]              Select all clips
## Canvas
[←]                    Nudge layer left 1 px
[→]                    Nudge layer right 1 px
[↑]                    Nudge layer up 1 px
[↓]                    Nudge layer down 1 px
[Shift][←]             Nudge layer left 10 px
[Shift][→]             Nudge layer right 10 px
[Shift][↑]             Nudge layer up 10 px
[Shift][↓]             Nudge layer down 10 px
-- Keys come from ~/.config/qrec/keys.toml. Change them in Settings › Keyboard.
